From 4e1c401292de666104e9854ba5cc749d01961fbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:35:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mwifiex: match mainline set_monitor_channel signature (>=
 6.12.101)

The moal driver gates the struct net_device *dev parameter of
set_monitor_channel on CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= 6.13.0. That argument was
originally slated for 6.13, but the change (torvalds/linux commit
9c4f830927750a2bf9fd9426a5257f0fdce3b662, "wifi: cfg80211: pass net_device
to set_monitor_channel") was backported to the 6.12.y stable series in
v6.12.101 for multi-radio wiphy support. Verified: v6.12.100 has the old
two-argument signature, v6.12.101 has the three-argument one.

OpenWrt builds this driver against its mac80211 backports package, so
CFG80211_VERSION_CODE reports >= 6.13 and the guard resolves. Armbian builds
against the kernel's in-kernel cfg80211, so on 6.12.101..6.12.103 the guard
selects the old signature and the cfg80211_ops assignment fails with
-Wincompatible-pointer-types. Lower the guard to 6.12.101 at the forward
declaration and the definition; the added dev parameter is unused by the
body. set_monitor_channel is the only cfg80211 op the 6.12.y stable series
backported that this driver guards.

Signed-off-by: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
---
 mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
index 21092c2..f9ea859 100644
--- a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
+++ b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
@@ -127,7 +127,7 @@ rmp_table_t rmp_table_sta_6G[] = {
 #ifdef UAP_SUPPORT
 #if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(3, 8, 0)
 static int woal_cfg80211_set_monitor_channel(struct wiphy *wiphy,
-#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 13, 0)
+#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 12, 101)
 					     struct net_device *dev,
 #endif
 					     struct cfg80211_chan_def *chandef);
@@ -699,7 +699,7 @@ static const struct wiphy_coalesce_support coalesce_support = {
 #ifdef UAP_SUPPORT
 #if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(3, 8, 0)
 static int woal_cfg80211_set_monitor_channel(struct wiphy *wiphy,
-#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 13, 0)
+#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 12, 101)
 					     struct net_device *dev,
 #endif
 					     struct cfg80211_chan_def *chandef)
-- 
2.47.3

